   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "originalText": "Data flow: act 6's record command on the demo's one process and the return to Security; the\nduplicate retry, the stale edit, the late Finance response and the canary's replay take the\nsame arrows; the evidence recorder reads what they returned (arrows: data flow in the direction\nthe data moves; label = Fn payload [protocol, authentication; data class])",
